### Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:5135/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Iniciar sesión
POST http://localhost:5135/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
